msgstr "Vispirms atsvaidzināt atjauninājumu sarakstu pēc:"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:95
msgid "Then, refresh the list of updates every:"
msgstr "Tad, atsvaidzināt atjauninājumu sarakstu ik pēc:"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:106
msgid ""
"Note: The list only gets refreshed while the Update Manager window is closed "
"(in system tray mode)."
msgstr ""
"Piezīme: saraksts tiek atsvaidzināts tikai tad, kad atjaunināšanas "
"pārvaldnieka logs ir aizvērts (sistēmas teknes režīmā)."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:110
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Paziņojumi"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:116
msgid "Only show notifications for security and kernel updates"
msgstr "Rādīt tikai paziņojumus par drošības un kodola atjauninājumiem"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:119
msgid ""
"Show a notification if an update has been available for (in logged-in days):"
msgstr ""
"Rādīt paziņojumu, ja ir pieejams atjauninājums (pieteikšanās dienās):"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:122
msgid "Show a notification if an update is older than (in days):"
msgstr "Rādīt paziņojumu, ja atjauninājums ir vecāks par (dienās):"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:125
msgid ""
"Don't show notifications if an update was applied in the last (in days):"
msgstr ""
"Neuzrādīt paziņojumus, ja atjauninājums tika piemērots pēdējās (dienās):"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:154
msgid "Update types"
msgstr "Atjauninājumu veidi"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:154
msgid "In addition to system packages, check for:"
msgstr "Papildus sistēmas pakotnēm pārbaudi:"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:156
msgid "Cinnamon spice updates"
msgstr "Cinnamon spice atjauninājumus"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:168
msgid "Ignored Updates"
msgstr "Ignorētie atjauninājumi"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:191
msgid "Package Updates"
msgstr "Pakotņu atjauninājumi"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:191
msgid "Performed as root on a daily basis"
msgstr "Veikts kā root ikdienā"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:192
msgid "Apply updates automatically"
msgstr "Automātiski piemērot atjauninājumus"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:196
msgid "Export blacklist to /etc/mintupdate.blacklist"
msgstr "Eksportēt melno sarakstu uz /etc/mintupdate.blacklist"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:200
msgid ""
"Click this button to make automatic updates use your current blacklist."
msgstr ""
"Noklikšķini uz šīs pogas, lai automātiskie atjauninājumi izmantotu tavu "
"pašreizējo melno sarakstu."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:206
msgid "Update Cinnamon spices automatically"
msgstr "Automātiski atjaunināt Cinnamon spices"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:209
msgid "Update Flatpaks automatically"
msgstr "Automātiski atjaunināt Flatpaks"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:212
msgid "Other Updates"
msgstr "Citi atjauninājumi"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:212
msgid "Performed when you log in"
msgstr "Veikts, kad piesakies sistēmā"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:251
msgid ""
"Please specify the source package name of the update to ignore (wildcards "
"are supported) and optionally the version:"
msgstr ""
"Lūdzu, norādi ignorējamo atjauninājuma avota pakotnes nosaukumu (atbalstīti "
"ir universālie simboli) un, ja vēlies, arī versiju:"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:252
msgid "Ignore an Update"
msgstr "Ignorēt atjauninājumu"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:260
msgid "Name:"
msgstr "Nosaukums:"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:262
msgid "Version:"
msgstr "Versija:"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/preferences.py:264
msgid "(optional)"
msgstr "(neobligāts)"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:22
msgid "System Upgrade"
msgstr "Sistēmas atjaunināšana"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:34
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Ievads"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:38
msgid ""
"Your system is missing critical components. A package corresponding to your "
"edition of Linux Mint should provide the virtual package 'mint-info' and the "
"file /etc/linuxmint/info."
msgstr ""
"Tavai sistēmai trūkst svarīgu komponentu. Tavai Linux Mint versijai "
"atbilstošajai pakotnei jāietver virtuāla pakotne 'mint-info' un fails "
"/etc/linuxmint/info."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:55
msgid "No upgrades were found."
msgstr "Atjauninājumi netika atrasti."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:64
msgid "A new version of Linux Mint is available!"
msgstr "Ir pieejama jauna Linux Mint versija!"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:85
#, python-format
msgid "An upgrade was found but it is not available yet for the %s edition."
msgstr "Tika atrasts atjauninājums, bet tas vēl nav pieejams %s versijai."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:94
msgid "Release notes"
msgstr "Izlaiduma piezīmes"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:101
msgid ""
"Please read the release notes before upgrading. They explain all the known "
"issues, workarounds and solutions associated with the new version."
msgstr ""
"Pirms atjaunināšanas izlasi izlaiduma piezīmes. Tajās ir izskaidrotas visas "
"zināmās problēmas, risinājumi un veidi, kā apiet problēmas, kas saistītas ar "
"jauno versiju."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:105
#, python-format
msgid "Release notes for %s"
msgstr "Izlaiduma piezīmes priekš %s"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:108
msgid "Click on the link to open the release notes."
msgstr "Noklikšķini uz saites, lai atvērtu izlaiduma piezīmes."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:116
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Jaunas funkcijas"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:123
msgid "Please look at the new features introduced in the new version."
msgstr "Apskati jaunajā versijā ieviestās jaunās funkcijas."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:127
#, python-format
msgid "New features in %s"
msgstr "Jaunās funkcijas iekš %s"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:130
msgid "Click on the link to browse the new features."
msgstr "Noklikšķini uz saites, lai apskatītu jaunās funkcijas."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:138
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Prasības"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:147
#, python-format
msgid "The package %s needs to be installed before upgrading."
msgstr "Pakotni %s nepieciešams instalēt pirms atjaunināšanas."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:151
#, python-format
msgid "Install %s"
msgstr "Instalēt %s"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:156
msgid "Click on the button to install the missing package."
msgstr "Noklikšķini uz pogas, lai instalētu trūkstošo pakotni."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:170
msgid ""
"New releases provide bug fixes and new features but they also sometimes "
"introduce new issues. Upgrading always represents a risk. Your data is safe "
"but new issues can potentially affect your operating system."
msgstr ""
"Jaunās versijas nodrošina kļūdu labojumus un jaunas funkcijas, bet dažkārt "
"rada arī jaunas problēmas. Atjaunināšana vienmēr ir saistīta ar risku. Tavi "
"dati ir drošībā, bet jaunas problēmas var ietekmēt tavu operētājsistēmu."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:174
#, python-format
msgid "I understand the risk. I want to upgrade to %s."
msgstr "Es apzinos risku. Es gribu jaunināt uz %s."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:184
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Kopsavilkums"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:254
msgid ""
"The upgrade did not succeed. Make sure you are connected to the Internet and "
"try to upgrade again."
msgstr ""
"Atjaunināšana nebija veiksmīga. Pārliecinies, vai esi pieslēdzies "
"internetam, un mēģini atjaunināt vēlreiz."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/rel_upgrade.py:263
msgid ""
"Your operating system was successfully upgraded. Please reboot your computer "
"for all changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Tava operētājsistēma tika veiksmīgi atjaunināta. Lūdzu, restartē datoru, lai "
"visas izmaiņas stātos spēkā."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/session_automatic_upgrades.py:42
msgid "The following spices were automatically updated:"
msgstr "Automātiski tika atjauninātas šādas spices (garšvielas):"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintUpdate/session_automatic_upgrades.py:57
msgid "Cinnamon was restarted"
msgstr "Cinnamon tika restartēts"

#: generate_desktop_files:26
msgid "Show and install available updates"
msgstr "Rādīt un instalēt pieejamos atjauninājumus"

